  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-003": { status: "hold", note: "third audit (review checklist): The names isopentane, neopentane, 2-methylbutane and 2,2-dimethylpropane are not in the NCERT chapter. The chapter only shows the butane isomers and the general idea of branched chains." },
